                <span class="module-text-wrap"><h4>Acompañamiento Educativo</h4><p>Refuerzo escolar comunitario, talleres y soporte pedagógico.</p></span>
                <span class="module-chev" aria-hidden="true"><Icon name="nav.desplegar" size={12} /></span>
              </label>
            </div>
            <div class="module-item">
              <input class="module-radio" type="radio" name="pdi-modulo" id="pdi-modulo-m3" />
              <label class="module-row" for="pdi-modulo-m3">
                <span class="module-icon-well" aria-hidden="true"><svg class="anim-svg-social" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8"><path class="anim-social-heart" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M19 14c1.49-1.46 3-3.21 3-5.5A5.5 5.5 0 0 0 16.5 3c-1.76 0-3 .5-4.5 2-1.5-1.5-2.74-2-4.5-2A5.5 5.5 0 0 0 2 8.5c0 2.3 1.5 4.05 3 5.5l7 7Z" /><path class="anim-social-hands" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M12 5l-2.5 2.5a2 2 0 0 0 0 2.8l.5.5a2 2 0 0 0 2.8 0l2-2" /><path class="anim-social-hands" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="m14 10 1.5 1.5a2 2 0 0 0 2.8 0" /></svg></span>
                <span class="module-text-wrap"><h4>Atención Social y Familiar</h4><p>Visitas domiciliarias, canalización de casos y expediente único.</p></span>
